  "details": "features\n1. features from the \"camera animations\" mod. this mod was commonly used by vrchat content creators and allowed us to make more diverse, and theatrical content.\n2. a UI color change option, to explain it simply allows you to change the color of your UI from blue, to any other color. this isnt a need, but simply a cosmetics thing.\n3. player history and instance history. say a person you liked crashed before you could friend them, simply go to player history and add them there! as for instance history, if you crash you can go to instance history and re-join the same instance.\n4. join notifier. so you can see if a friend joins the world.\n5. pre-load worlds. an option to pre-load a world before entering.\n 6. the ability to search avatars. we have been asking for this for such a long time and it has not been implemented. you can add a “allow avatar search” option in the SDK so people can choose if they want it to be searchable \n7. an avatar scale, so you can make avatars smaller or bigger. this is a feature already implemented in some avatars as well.\n8. avatar immobilize. like a built in stationary feature as not all avatars have locomotion. \n9. BETTER IK TWEAKS!!\n10. desktop camera so we can take pics / record a bit easier \n11. preview scroller so you can control where the preview of the avatar is looking",
